<title>FRANCE: L'Oreal H1 sales 34.02 billion Ffr.</title>
<headline>L'Oreal H1 sales 34.02 billion Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover		    34,021	 vs    30,114</p>
<p>NOTE - L'Oreal gave its figures in the Official Bulletin (Balo). It said that on a like-for-like basis, sales rose 8.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
